        472.41943359375,
        146.98768615722656
      ],
      "text": "BLMZ 9Bdq-Lzd-Mfx-Z Bedaquiline-linezolid-moxifloxacin-pyrazinamide",
      "font": "SegoeUI-SemiBold",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        77.66929626464844,
        154.0494384765625,
        524.2623901367188,
        168.60243225097656
      ],
      "text": "BLLfxCZ 9Bdq-Lzd-Lfx-Cfz-Z Bedaquiline-linezolid-levofloxacin-clofazimine-pyrazinamide",
      "font": "SegoeUI-SemiBold",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        77.66929626464844,
        175.66400146484375,
        521.7642822265625,
        190.2169952392578
      ],
      "text": "BDLLfxZ 9Bdq-Dlm-Lzd-Lfx-Z Bedaquiline-delamanid-linezolid-levofloxacin-pyrazinamide",
      "font": "SegoeUI-SemiBold",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        209.28504943847656,
        527.1912841796875,
        223.72804260253906
      ],
      "text": "The dosing for linezolid and bedaquiline in these regimens deviates slightly from the standard dosing",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.987993240356445,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        222.48500061035156,
        226.68991088867188,
        236.92799377441406
      ],
      "text": "used in other treatment regimens:",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        244.1889190673828,
        78.23609924316406,
        258.6319274902344
      ],
      "text": "•",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        78.23609924316406,
        244.1889190673828,
        527.4478759765625,
        258.6319274902344
      ],
      "text": "in the trial participants received linezolid at 600 mg once daily for 16 weeks then randomized to",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        82.86609649658203,
        257.388916015625,
        527.3118896484375,
        271.8319396972656
      ],
      "text": "either reduced dose of 300 mg once daily or 600 mg three times a week until the end of treatment,",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.981083869934082,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        82.86609649658203,
        270.58892822265625,
        317.3212890625,
        285.0319519042969
      ],
      "text": "outcomes appeared to be similar for both options;",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        283.78887939453125,
        78.23609924316406,
        298.2319030761719
      ],
      "text": "•",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        78.23609924316406,
        283.78887939453125,
        527.4422607421875,
        298.2319030761719
      ],
      "text": "bedaquiline was dosed at 400 mg daily for the first 2 weeks, followed by 200 mg three times a",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        82.86609649658203,
        296.9888916015625,
        235.0181121826172,
        311.4319152832031
      ],
      "text": "week for the full 9-month period.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        318.69281005859375,
        527.5057373046875,
        333.1358337402344
      ],
      "text": "Both options for linezolid dosing strategy can be used. The alternative daily dosing of bedaquiline was",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.972314834594727,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        331.8927917480469,
        527.3715209960938,
        346.3358154296875
      ],
      "text": "not used in the modified 9-month regimens; however, it is considered an equivalent option that may",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        345.0928039550781,
        527.3860473632812,
        359.53582763671875
      ],
      "text": "simplify treatment for the patient by requiring the same number of pills every day, streamlining the",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        358.2928161621094,
        527.2735595703125,
        372.73583984375
      ],
      "text": "dosing schedule. Dosing of the other drugs in the modified 9-month regimen follows the standardized",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.961181640625,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        371.4927978515625,
        474.6696472167969,
        385.9358215332031
      ],
      "text": "weight-based dosing of medicines used in MDR/RR-TB regimens, for adults and children",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        402.3367004394531,
        339.0997314453125,
        417.9967041015625
      ],
      "text": "Regimen duration, extension and discontinuation",
      "font": "SegoeUI-SemiBold",
      "size": 12.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        425.2046203613281,
        527.4125366210938,
        439.64764404296875
      ],
      "text": "In general, the individual drugs in the modified 9-month regimens are all used for the full 9-month",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        438.40460205078125,
        527.3770751953125,
        452.8476257324219
      ],
      "text": "duration. All three endTB trial regimens were stopped at month 9 without an option for extending",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        451.6046142578125,
        527.2377319335938,
        466.0476379394531
      ],
      "text": "the duration. Discontinuation of either pyrazinamide or linezolid due to adverse events may be",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        464.8045959472656,
        527.3858032226562,
        479.24761962890625
      ],
      "text": "considered, and the regimen may continue with the remaining drugs. However, if more than a single",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        478.0046081542969,
        527.6201171875,
        492.4476318359375
      ],
      "text": "drug needs to be discontinued, the regimen should be stopped and an alternative treatment started.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.991997718811035,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        499.7086181640625,
        527.4387817382812,
        514.151611328125
      ],
      "text": "Where there is a lack of clinical or bacteriological response (e.g. culture remains positive or reverts",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        512.9085083007812,
        527.6643676757812,
        527.3515014648438
      ],
      "text": "positive at month 4 or beyond), there should be an investigation for a possible undiagnosed or",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        526.1085205078125,
        188.71461486816406,
        540.551513671875
      ],
      "text": "acquired drug resistance.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        556.952392578125,
        302.2884826660156,
        572.6124267578125
      ],
      "text": "Missing doses and treatment interruptions",
      "font": "SegoeUI-SemiBold",
      "size": 12.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        579.8204345703125,
        527.549560546875,
        594.263427734375
      ],
      "text": "Making up for missed doses follows routine TB practice when accumulative interruption of all medicines",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.945263862609863,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        593.0203857421875,
        324.626220703125,
        607.46337890625
      ],
      "text": "in the regimen exceeds 7 days but is less than a month.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        623.8643188476562,
        168.60972595214844,
        639.5243530273438
      ],
      "text": "Care and support",
      "font": "SegoeUI-SemiBold",
      "size": 12.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        646.732177734375,
        527.5830078125,
        661.1751708984375
      ],
      "text": "Treatment administration coupled with patient support can boost adherence and ensure optimal",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        659.9321899414062,
        527.4420776367188,
        674.3751831054688
      ],
      "text": "drug effectiveness and safety of patients on treatment. Measures to support patient adherence (e.g.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        673.132080078125,
        527.3716430664062,
        687.5750732421875
      ],
      "text": "by facilitating patient visits to health care facilities or home visits by health care staff, or by using",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        686.3320922851562,
        527.3912963867188,
        700.7750854492188
      ],
      "text": "digital technologies for daily communication) may be important to retain patients on treatment, even",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.986991882324219,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        699.5322265625,
        527.4387817382812,
        713.9752197265625
      ],
      "text": "when a regimen is comparatively short. WHO recommendations on care and support are discussed",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
